  "releaseNotes": "Removed CS1066 warning from generated pipeline code.\n      \n      Introduced unified validation layer for TinyDispatcher source generator.\n\n      - Added IGeneratorValidator, GeneratorValidationContext, DiagnosticBag\n      - Added PipelineDiagnosticsValidator\n      - Enforced single UseTinyDispatcher<TContext> call per host project\n      - Added pipeline diagnostics:\n      * Middleware targeting unknown command (warning)\n      * Policy targeting unknown command (warning)\n      * Multiple policies targeting same command (warning)\n      - Migrated duplicate handler validation to unified validation system\n      - Internal generator cleanup and consistency improvements\n\n      No breaking API changes.",
